There are a bunch of options to consider.

First off, I'd argue that having a checkboxGroupInput that large isn't a good user experience anyway. Have you considered using a selectize box? There's a server-side version of it that's designed for very large numbers of choices like this (both in terms of performance and in terms of UI design). See http://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/selectize.html, especially the section on "Server-side selectize".

If you have your heart set on using checkboxGroupInput then we can work around the performance issue by crafting the HTML directly, rather than using HTML tag objects, which are flexible and expressive but also quite slow. Let me know if you really want to do that and I'll send you some code.

