Figured out what I was missing. '.shiny-notification' controls the box, while '.shine-progress-notification .progress' controls the loading bar. Here's some code:

tags$style(HTML('

      .shiny-notification {
      width: 200%;
      height: 400px;
      margin-left: -400px;
      }

      .shiny-progress-notification .progress {
      margin-top: 20px;
      height: 250px;
      width: 90%;
      }

'))

